# 1. PRODUCT OBJECTIVE

PayTune is a professional, YouTube-inspired video marketplace with a pay-once, watch-forever business model.

Users can discover videos, watch free previews, purchase individual paid videos, and stream purchased videos again without paying a recurring subscription or being charged twice for the same video.

Approved creators and administrators can upload and publish video content. Creators earn a configurable percentage of successful sales. PayTune retains its platform commission.

The application must have three fully integrated experiences:

1. Public video discovery and viewer experience.
2. Creator Studio and earnings dashboard.
3. Administrator and super-administrator control panels.

The application must use real database records and real backend functionality. Do not ship hardcoded dashboard statistics, fake purchases, fabricated creator earnings, simulated payment success, or default videos presented as real user uploads.

Demo data may exist only in isolated development seeds, clearly identified as demo content.

